        <mxCell id="task_24" value="&lt;span style='font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;'&gt;[Service Task]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b style='font-size:10.5px;'&gt;Engine.closeShift: Tạo bản ghi Z-Report, Khóa sổ ca (sh.closedAt) &amp; Đồng bộ trạng thái vào PostgreSQL 16&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b style='font-size:10px;color:#b85450;'&gt;[Auto-Lock] Tự động khóa&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=mxgraph.bpmn.task;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rectStyle=rounded;size=10;taskMarker=service;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="lane_8">
